---
import {topics} from '../data/site';
import {scenarios,scenarioCandidates} from '../data/selection';
import BrandCard from './BrandCard.astro';
const entry=scenarioCandidates('beginner').slice(0,3);
---
<div class="page-body editorial-hub"><section class="section-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHOOSE BY YOUR TASK</span><h2>先选使用场景，再看品牌与套餐</h2><p>六个专题分别说明筛选条件、预算取舍与付款前核对项。品牌范围与默认目录顺序保持一致，参考资料与实际体验分开说明。</p></div><div class="hub-stat"><strong>29</strong><span>指定品牌</span><small>统一资料 · 来源可查</small></div></section><div class="scenario-grid">{topics.map((topic,i)=><article class="scenario-tile"><span class="scenario-index">0{i+1} / {topic.icon}</span><h2>{scenarios[topic.slug].title}</h2><p>{scenarios[topic.slug].subtitle}</p><small>{topic.slug==='premium'||topic.slug==='stable'||topic.slug==='ai'||topic.slug==='streaming'?'先核条件，再验证任务':'先看预算与容量匹配'}</small><a class="button secondary" href={`/recommend/${topic.slug}/`}>进入专题 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>)}</div><section class="selection-path"><h2>一条清晰的选择路径</h2><ol><li><strong>写下自己的需求</strong><span>设备、用量、预算和关键应用。</span></li><li><strong>核对资料的边界</strong><span>当前价格、倍率、客户端和退款条件。</span></li><li><strong>比较 2–4 家候选</strong><span>先短期验证，再决定是否持续投入。</span></li></ol><a class="button" href="/compare/">开始机场对比 →</a></section><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">A STARTING SHORTLIST</span><h2>从小额月付的参考档开始核对</h2><p>按“不超过 30 元、至少 100GB”筛选的前三家；保留目录顺序，并非性能排名。</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/airport/">全部 29 品牌 →</a></div><div class="grid three">{entry.map(({airport,plan})=><BrandCard airport={airport} plan={plan}/>)}</div><div class="dossier-evidence"><strong>推广关系与资料范围</strong><p>品牌及目录顺序由站长指定，链接含推广关系。价格是有来源的第三方参考，未登录核实当前结算；本站未开展网络、AI 或流媒体实测。</p><a href="/editorial-policy/">查看完整标准与披露 →</a></div></div>
